config ONTHE15_BATTERY_NIMH_DIAGNOSTIC
    bool "On the 15 NiMH battery monitor"
    default n
    select ADC
    select SENSOR
    help
      Read one or more series-connected Eneloop AAA cells through vbat_sense
      and estimate state of charge from the Panasonic BK-4MCC discharge curve.

config ONTHE15_BATTERY_SETTINGS_SPLIT_SYNC
    bool "Send battery settings from the split central to its peripherals"
    default y
    depends on ONTHE15_BATTERY_SETTINGS && ZMK_SPLIT
    select ZMK_SPLIT_RELAY_EVENT
    help
      Each half reads its own cell and warns about its own charge, so the
      chemistry curve and the warning switch have to hold on both. The battery
      behavior is global, so a key toggle reaches both, but a change made from
      Studio reaches only the central. This relays it, the same way the
      indicator and the lighting relay theirs.

config ONTHE15_BATTERY_SETTINGS
    bool "On the 15 battery warning and chemistry settings"
    default n
    depends on ONTHE15_BATTERY_NIMH_DIAGNOSTIC
    select SETTINGS
